## Caption & sidecar rules (do not break)

### Stable Diffusion caption output
- Keep existing JSON fields untouched; **add** `sd_caption` (do not rename or repurpose existing fields).
- Write `<image>.txt` alongside the image containing **only** `sd_caption`.
- Overwrite on reprocessing; ensure it moves with the image on archive.
- Style: PG-13 fine-art; include pose, styling/material, lighting, mood.

### Expanded metadata & sidecars
- Respect existing sidecar schemas and extended analysis fields:
  - `docs_v2/roadmap/archive/PUB-003_expanded-vision-analysis.md`
  - `docs_v2/roadmap/archive/PUB-004_caption-extended-metadata.md`
- Do not change field names/semantics without updating specs, tests, and migration notes.
